    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InspoQuest is a two-button rhythm platformer with music tracks by Trust This Mechanism. Jump, roll, glide, and more as you make your way through three levels inspired by the city of Vancouver, Canada.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LISTEN TO SICK BEATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your actions to the beats and vocals of three songs from Trust This Mechanism.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT INSPO FOR A NEW SONG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the inspo orbs laying out the path across three levels. By gathering enough, you can discover a new song from Trust This Mechanism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE VANCOUVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look out for landmarks and interesting details that shows the highlights of Vancouver, a city that inspired Trust This Mechanism's music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK CUTE HATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hat tickets in each level and spend them to unlock hats you can wear while playing.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InspoQuest is a two-button rhythm platformer with music tracks by Trust This Mechanism. Jump, roll, glide, and more as you make your way through three levels inspired by the city of Vancouver, Canada.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LISTEN TO SICK BEATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your actions to the beats and vocals of three songs from Trust This Mechanism.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT INSPO FOR A NEW SONG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the inspo orbs laying out the path across three levels. By gathering enough, you can discover a new song from Trust This Mechanism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE VANCOUVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look out for landmarks and interesting details that shows the highlights of Vancouver, a city that inspired Trust This Mechanism's music.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK CUTE HATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hat tickets in each level and spend them to unlock hats you can wear while playing.</p>",
